note for Hq "Role associations show the default permitted capabilities. Configured module access and backend authorization still apply."
note for logistics "Submission is restricted to team leaders. Resource requests and live fulfillment need acceptance verification."
note for offlineView "Viewing cached pages is implemented. This does not provide offline household submissions, downloadable map tiles or offline voice communication."
note for evacuationVerify "Backend verification exists; the complete staff scan/entry interface remains a required gap."
note for personnel "Registration is performed by authorized staff; public self-registration is not part of this system."
note for escalate "Manual export and handoff; automatic city receipt or acknowledgment is not claimed."

